    "raw": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<!-- content-architecture-2026:work -->\n<style>\n.kk-r9-pack :where(p, li)::first-letter {\n  initial-letter: normal !important;\n  font-size: inherit !important;\n  font-weight: inherit !important;\n  float: none !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  line-height: inherit !important;\n  color: inherit !important;\n  background: transparent !important;\n}\n.kk-r9-pack .aurora-button,\n.kk-r9-pack a.aurora-button {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 0.7rem 1.1rem;\n  border: 1px solid #171310;\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  background: #171310;\n  color: #efe6d2 !important;\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n}\n.kk-r9-pack .aurora-button:hover,\n.kk-r9-pack a.aurora-button:hover {\n  background: #d94a1f;\n  border-color: #d94a1f;\n  color: #efe6d2 !important;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n}\n.kk-r9-pack .aurora-card,\n.kk-r9-pack .aurora-media-card {\n  border-radius: 2px !important;\n  box-shadow: none !important;\n}\n</style>\n<div class=\"kk-page kk-r9-pack\">\n<section class=\"aurora-proof-section\">\n  <p class=\"aurora-section-kicker\">Work</p>\n  <h2 class=\"aurora-display-heading\">Systems, rooms, stories, and strange machines.</h2>\n  <p class=\"aurora-page-lead\">My work lives where creative technology meets public culture: AI community infrastructure, keynote systems, responsible training, visual storytelling, and experimental internet projects that help people make sense of what is coming.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"aurora-proof-section\">\n  <p class=\"aurora-section-kicker\">Featured systems</p>\n  <div class=\"aurora-proof-grid\">\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://bc-ai.ca/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/bc-ai.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bcai-living-ecosystem.webp?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"BC AI ecosystem network graphic\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>BC + AI Ecosystem</h3>\n          <p>Community infrastructure for responsible and inclusive AI across British Columbia.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"/responsible-ai-professional/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n        <img src=\"https://kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/rap-why-we-built-cover.png\" alt=\"Responsible AI Professional certification cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Responsible AI Professional</h3>\n          <p>A cohort-based certification for teams who need practical ethics while shipping real systems.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"/speaking/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/kk-laSalle-both-hands-full-25-scaled.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"Kris Krug speaking on stage at LaSalle College Vancouver\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>AI keynotes</h3>\n          <p>Talks and workshops about AI, taste, creativity, community, responsibility, and what we refuse to automate.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://indigenomics.ai/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/image-19.png?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"Indigenomics AI visual from Kris Krug's public writing\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Indigenomics AI</h3>\n          <p>Support for Indigenous-led conversations about technology, sovereignty, economics, and future-building.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"aurora-proof-section\">\n  <p class=\"aurora-section-kicker\">Creative AI Human Lab</p>\n  <div class=\"aurora-proof-grid\">\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.bothhandsfull.com/album/too-weird-to-die\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" aria-label=\"Explore Too Weird to Die\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/kk-laSalle-both-hands-full-25-scaled.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"Kris Krug presenting Both Hands Full at LaSalle College Vancouver\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/>\n        <span class=\"aurora-card-label\">Concept album</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Too Weird to Die</h3>\n          <p>A Suno-first Both Hands Full album about consent, defiance, survival, and refusing to sand the contradiction flat.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.punkrockai.com/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" aria-label=\"Explore Punk Rock AI\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.punkrockai.com/public/photos/michelle-diamond/195.webp?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"Kris Krug speaking at CreativeMornings Vancouver for Punk Rock AI\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/>\n        <span class=\"aurora-card-label\">Creative rebellion</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Punk Rock AI</h3>\n          <p>Writing, talks, and experiments for people who want the technology without the obedience training.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://ethosblockparty.com/the-day\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" aria-label=\"Explore Ethos Lab Block Party\">\n        <img src=\"https://ethosblockparty.com/the-day-og.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" alt=\"Ethos Lab Block Party album artwork\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/>\n        <span class=\"aurora-card-label\">Community album</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Ethos Lab Block Party</h3>\n          <p>Eleven songs made from real conversations in one afternoon, with consent, first-name care, and the person as the hero.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://kriskrug.co/work/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" aria-label=\"Explore KrisKrug.co Work\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/krug-1.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"Portrait of Kris Krug, the Creative AI Human Lab network hub\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/>\n        <span class=\"aurora-card-label\">Network hub</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3>KrisKrug.co Work</h3>\n          <p>The home base for the archive, field notes, services, speaking proof, and connective tissue across the creative AI network.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://skywhaleairways.com/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" aria-label=\"Explore Skywhale Airways\">\n        <img src=\"https://skywhaleairways.com/social/i-am-nomad-og.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" alt=\"I AM NOMAD Skywhale Airways key art\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/>\n        <span class=\"aurora-card-label\">AI film + microsite</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Skywhale Airways</h3>\n          <p><em>I AM NOMAD</em> is a 53-second AI Film Club short and hand-built site: a psychedelic airport for time travelers, made with Suzy Easton.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://gorgeousghost.com/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" aria-label=\"Explore Gorgeous Ghost\">\n        <img src=\"https://gorgeousghost.com/og/share.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" alt=\"The jeweled Gorgeous Ghost title and lightning-bolt eye in a field of stars\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/>\n        <span class=\"aurora-card-label\">Glam space opera</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Gorgeous Ghost</h3>\n          <p>A 69.42-second film, song, and Signal Atlas from Planet Andromeda, made for the BC + AI Film Club Prompt Challenge.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://wedges.dev/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" aria-label=\"Explore Wedges\">\n        <img src=\"https://wedges.dev/opengraph-image?841e0fb7ee13efa4\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" alt=\"Wedges wordmark and the agent edition of Both Hands Full\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/>\n        <span class=\"aurora-card-label\">Agent tool</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Wedges</h3>\n          <p>The agent edition of Both Hands Full: a remote MCP server that hands an agent your taste before it touches your work.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://ghost.radio.fm/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" aria-label=\"Explore Ghost Radio\">\n        <span class=\"aurora-card-label\">Audio signal</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Ghost Radio</h3>\n          <p>A small broadcast surface for the haunted, song-shaped side of the lab — a companion signal to Gorgeous Ghost and the other public artifacts.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n        <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://darkcrystal.app/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" aria-label=\"Explore Dark Crystal\">\n        <img src=\"https://darkcrystal.app/lab/opengraph-image\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" alt=\"Dark Crystal wordmark and anti-slop machine\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/>\n        <span class=\"aurora-card-label\">Anti-slop machine</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Dark Crystal</h3>\n          <p>A live facet that eats slop, refuses at the edge, and hands back one clean human sentence.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://unofficial.city/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" aria-label=\"Explore unofficial.city\">\n        <img src=\"https://unofficial.city/og.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" alt=\"MADE ON double silver graphic with the Nardwuar FC kit\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/>\n        <span class=\"aurora-card-label\">Local artifacts</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3>unofficial.city</h3>\n          <p>MADE ON: a protest kit collection that cites its sources, shows its process, and names the numbers.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n<article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"/photography/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" aria-label=\"Explore the photography archive\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/20067931301_e7a16b6f2c_k-1.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"1200\" height=\"772\" alt=\"Kris Krug backstage with Malcolm Gladwell from the photography archive\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/>\n        <span class=\"aurora-card-label\">Visual archive</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Photography archive</h3>\n          <p>Two decades of visual storytelling from conferences, movements, expeditions, music, and the people inside the machine.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"aurora-proof-section\">\n  <div class=\"aurora-card\">\n    <h2>Bring this work into your room</h2>\n    <p>If you need a keynote, training program, ecosystem partner, or creative AI collaborator, start with the shape of the room and the people it needs to serve.</p>\n    <p><a class=\"aurora-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Talk about a project</a></p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n",
